---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Logo from '../components/Logo.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Terms of Service & Disclaimers — BCAway"
  description="Terms of Service, Non-Affiliation Notice, and Complete Limitation of Liability for BCAway."
>
  <main class="policy-page">
    <div class="policy-wrapper">
      <nav class="policy-nav">
        <a href="/" class="back-link">
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
            <line x1="19" y1="12" x2="5" y2="12"></line>
            <polyline points="12 19 5 12 12 5"></polyline>
          </svg>
          Back to BCAway
        </a>
      </nav>

      <header class="policy-header">
        <div class="logo-small">
          <Logo width={48} />
        </div>
        <h1 class="policy-title">Terms of Service & Legal Disclaimers</h1>
        <p class="policy-meta">Last Updated: September 24, 2026 • Effective Immediately</p>
      </header>

      <div class="policy-content">
        <!-- Critical Legal Notice Banner -->
        <div class="warning-callout">
          <h3>CRITICAL LEGAL NOTICE: NON-AFFILIATION & ABSOLUTE RELEASE OF LIABILITY</h3>
          <p>
            BCAWAY IS AN INDEPENDENT STUDENT UTILITY DEVELOPED BY KABIR SEKHON AND PUBLISHED BY SAVERA CONTINENTAL LTD. 
            <strong>IT IS NOT AFFILIATED WITH, ENDORSED BY, SPONSORED BY, OR IN ANY WAY ASSOCIATED WITH BERGEN COUNTY ACADEMIES (BCA), THE BERGEN COUNTY TECHNICAL SCHOOL DISTRICT (BCTS), OR THE BERGEN COUNTY BOARD OF EDUCATION.</strong>
          </p>
          <p>
            NEITHER BCTS, BCA, KABIR SEKHON, NOR SAVERA CONTINENTAL LTD. ASSUMES ANY LEGAL RESPONSIBILITY OR LIABILITY WHATSOEVER FOR ANY ERRORS, OMISSIONS, ATTENDANCE DISCREPANCIES, DISCIPLINARY ACTIONS, OR RELIANCE UPON INFORMATION PRESENTED IN THIS APPLICATION.
          </p>
        </div>

        <section class="policy-section">
          <h2>1. Acceptance of Terms</h2>
          <p>
            By downloading, installing, accessing, or using the <strong>BCAway</strong> iOS application, Android application, or web application (<a href="https://app.bcaway.app">app.bcaway.app</a>), you explicitly agree to be legally bound by these Terms of Service and Disclaimers. If you do not agree to every term set forth herein, you must immediately uninstall and cease all use of the application.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="policy-section">
          <h2>2. Non-Affiliation Declaration</h2>
          <p>
            You acknowledge and understand that:
          </p>
          <ul>
            <li>BCAway is entirely independent and is not an official school communication service.</li>
            <li>Bergen County Academies (BCA) and the Bergen County Technical School District (BCTS) do not maintain, operate, review, control, or endorse this software.</li>
            <li>Any trademarks, school names, period terminology ("IGS", "BCA"), or references are used purely descriptively under nominative fair use to describe publicly posted school schedules.</li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section class="policy-section">
          <h2>3. Student Account Verification & Authorized Access</h2>
          <p>
            To protect faculty information and maintain the security of teacher absence notices, access to absence records within BCAway requires student verification:
          </p>
          <ul>
            <li><strong>Eligible Accounts:</strong> Access is restricted strictly to active students possessing a valid district email address ending in <code>@bergen.org</code>.</li>
            <li><strong>Passwordless Confirmation Links:</strong> Sign-in is completed via email confirmation links (magic links). You are responsible for maintaining the confidentiality of your school email account and any sign-in links delivered to it.</li>
            <li><strong>Prohibition of Circumvention:</strong> Any attempt to forge authentication tokens, bypass domain checks, share confirmation links with unauthorized individuals outside the school community, or circumvent database Row-Level Security (RLS) policies is strictly prohibited and grounds for immediate termination of access.</li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section class="policy-section">
          <h2>4. Acceptable Use & Anti-Scraping Rules</h2>
          <p>
            You agree to use BCAway solely for personal, non-commercial educational scheduling purposes. You expressly agree that you will not:
          </p>
          <ul>
            <li>Deploy automated scripts, bots, spiders, crawlers, or scrapers to extract absence notices, schedules, or API endpoints.</li>
            <li>Probe, scan, reverse-engineer, or test the vulnerability of our authentication systems, Cloudflare edge workers, or Supabase backend.</li>
            <li>Impersonate any student, teacher, school staff member, or school administrator.</li>
            <li>Overload, flood, or disrupt our network infrastructure or degrade the availability of the service for other students.</li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section class="policy-section">
          <h2>5. "As-Is" & "As-Available" Informational Disclaimer</h2>
          <p>
            BCAway is provided strictly on an <strong>"AS-IS"</strong> and <strong>"AS-AVAILABLE"</strong> basis without warranties of any kind, whether express, implied, statutory, or otherwise:
          </p>
          <ul>
            <li><strong>No Guarantee of Accuracy:</strong> Absence data and bell schedules are parsed from publicly available or school-posted notice boards. Information may be delayed, incomplete, superseded, or contain inaccuracies.</li>
            <li><strong>Unannounced Schedule Alterations:</strong> School schedules are subject to unannounced changes by school administration at any time (e.g., emergency drills, assemblies, weather delays, substitute teacher coverage, room reassignments).</li>
            <li><strong>Non-Binding:</strong> No information in this app constitutes official confirmation of teacher absence or free period authorization.</li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section class="policy-section">
          <h2>6. Student Attendance Responsibility</h2>
          <p>
            <strong>Students remain 100% personally responsible for adhering to all official school attendance regulations and policies set by Bergen County Academies and the BCTS Board of Education.</strong>
          </p>
          <ul>
            <li>Students must confirm with a faculty member, proctor, or school administration before assuming they are permitted to leave a classroom or report to common areas (cafeteria, library, auditorium).</li>
            <li>Relying on information provided by BCAway does not excuse tardiness, cutting class, absence from assigned study halls, or failure to report to designated substitute locations.</li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section class="policy-section">
          <h2>7. Comprehensive Limitation of Liability</h2>
          <p>
            TO THE FULLEST EXTENT PERMITTED BY APPLICABLE LAW, IN NO EVENT SHALL:
          </p>
          <ul>
            <li><strong>Bergen County Technical Schools (BCTS), Bergen County Academies (BCA), or their trustees, officers, administrators, teachers, and employees;</strong></li>
            <li><strong>Kabir Sekhon (Developer); OR</strong></li>
            <li><strong>Savera Continental LTD. (Publisher), its officers, directors, agents, and affiliates;</strong></li>
          </ul>
          <p>
            BE LIABLE TO YOU OR ANY THIRD PARTY FOR ANY DIRECT, INDIRECT, INCIDENTAL, SPECIAL, CONSEQUENTIAL, EXEMPLARY, OR PUNITIVE DAMAGES, INCLUDING BUT NOT LIMITED TO:
          </p>
          <ol>
            <li>Academic disciplinary actions, detentions, suspensions, attendance infractions, loss of credit, or grade reductions;</li>
            <li>Failure to receive, view, or parse accurate schedule or absence notices;</li>
            <li>Device malfunctions, data loss, interruption of service, or push notification delivery delays;</li>
            <li>Any loss, harm, or inconvenience arising out of or in connection with your access to or use of, or inability to access or use, BCAway.</li>
          </ol>
        </section>

        <section class="policy-section">
          <h2>8. Indemnification</h2>
          <p>
            You agree to defend, indemnify, and hold harmless Kabir Sekhon, Savera Continental LTD., Bergen County Academies, and Bergen County Technical Schools from and against any claims, liabilities, damages, losses, costs, expenses, or fees (including reasonable attorneys' fees) arising from or relating to your use of BCAway, violation of school policies, or violation of these Terms.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="policy-section">
          <h2>9. Account Termination & Revocation</h2>
          <p>
            We reserve the right, in our sole discretion and without prior notice, to suspend or terminate access to BCAway, invalidate authentication sessions, or block IP addresses for any user who violates these Terms, abuses API resources, or attempts unauthorized access to teacher attendance data.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="policy-section">
          <h2>10. Intellectual Property & License</h2>
          <p>
            The software, UI design, code, graphics, and branding of BCAway are licensed under the GNU Affero General Public License (AGPL) v3.0, unless otherwise noted. You may not misrepresent the origin of this software or use it to mislead users regarding school affiliation.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="policy-section">
          <h2>11. Governing Law & Severability</h2>
          <p>
            These Terms shall be governed by and construed in accordance with the laws of the State of New Jersey, United States, without giving effect to any principles of conflicts of law. If any provision of these Terms is found to be unlawful, void, or for any reason unenforceable, then that provision shall be deemed severable and shall not affect the validity and enforceability of any remaining provisions.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="policy-section">
          <h2>12. Contact Information</h2>
          <p>
            For legal inquiries, feedback, or support, please contact:
          </p>
          <div class="contact-card">
            <p><strong>Publisher:</strong> Savera Continental LTD.</p>
            <p><strong>Developer:</strong> Kabir Sekhon</p>
            <p><strong>Email:</strong> <a href="mailto:kabsek30@bergen.org">kabsek30@bergen.org</a></p>
            <p><strong>Website:</strong> <a href="https://bcaway.app">bcaway.app</a></p>
          </div>
        </section>
      </div>

      <footer class="policy-footer">
        <div class="footer-links-group">
          <a href="/" class="footer-back-link">Return to Home</a>
          <span class="footer-sep">•</span>
          <a href="/privacy" class="footer-back-link">Privacy Policy</a>
          <span class="footer-sep">•</span>
          <a href="mailto:kabsek30@bergen.org" class="footer-back-link">Contact</a>
        </div>
        <p class="copyright-text">
          &copy; {new Date().getFullYear()} Kabir Sekhon. All rights reserved.
        </p>
      </footer>
    </div>
  </main>
</Layout>

<style>
  .policy-page {
    flex: 1;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    padding: 48px 20px 60px;
    background-color: var(--color-bg);
  }

  .policy-wrapper {
    max-width: 680px;
    width: 100%;
  }

  .policy-nav {
    margin-bottom: 28px;
  }

  .back-link {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 6px;
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--color-primary);
    transition: opacity 0.15s ease;
  }

  .back-link:hover {
    opacity: 0.8;
  }

  .policy-header {
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    padding-bottom: 24px;
    margin-bottom: 32px;
  }

  .logo-small {
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }

  .policy-title {
    font-size: 32px;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: var(--color-text-main);
    letter-spacing: -0.025em;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }

  .policy-meta {
    font-size: 13px;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
  }

  .warning-callout {
    background-color: #FEF2F2;
    border: 1px solid #FECACA;
    border-left: 4px solid #DC2626;
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    padding: 18px 20px;
    margin-bottom: 36px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 10px;
  }

  .warning-callout h3 {
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    color: #991B1B;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .warning-callout p {
    font-size: 13.5px;
    line-height: 1.55;
    color: #7F1D1D;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .policy-content {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 32px;
  }

  .policy-section h2 {
    font-size: 20px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--color-text-main);
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }

  .policy-section p {
    font-size: 15px;
    line-height: 1.65;
    color: #374151;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }

  .policy-section p:last-child {
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  .policy-section ul, .policy-section ol {
    margin: 8px 0 16px 22px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 8px;
  }

  .policy-section li {
    font-size: 14.5px;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: #374151;
  }

  .policy-section code {
    font-size: 13px;
    background-color: var(--color-surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    padding: 2px 5px;
    border-radius: 4px;
    font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Monaco, Consolas, monospace;
  }

  .policy-section a {
    color: var(--color-primary);
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-underline-offset: 3px;
  }

  .policy-section a:hover {
    color: var(--color-primary-hover);
  }

  .contact-card {
    background-color: var(--color-surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    padding: 16px 20px;
    margin-top: 12px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 6px;
  }

  .contact-card p {
    font-size: 14px;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .policy-footer {
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    padding-top: 28px;
    margin-top: 48px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 12px;
    font-size: 13px;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
  }

  .footer-links-group {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 12px;
  }

  .copyright-text {
    font-size: 12px;
    color: var(--color-text-tertiary);
  }

  .footer-back-link:hover {
    color: var(--color-primary);
  }

  .footer-sep {
    color: var(--color-border);
  }

  @media (max-width: 480px) {
    .policy-page {
      padding: 32px 16px 48px;
    }

    .policy-title {
      font-size: 28px;
    }
  }
</style>
